			"Message": "docs(Rest): Document deep-shim interception system in Architecture.md\n\nAdd a Shim Compatibility section to the Architecture reference documenting the\n🟠 Low-Level / 🔵 Coverage dual-tier shim system for intercepting VS Code\nengine events. Each tier is detailed with its gating env var (`TierShim`), hook\ntype (prototype vs service), and specific modules (Error, Emitter, IPC\nSwallowMap, etc.).\n\nThe section notes that no shim-specific modules live in Rest itself — events\nroute through Wind, Mountain, and Cocoon — and links to the Shim\ndocumentation. Default gating state is `None` (zero overhead at runtime).",
